{
  "text": "On the authority of Abu Sayyid al-Khudri, may Allah be pleased with him, who said, I heard the Messenger of Allah, may the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him, say, Whosoever of you sees an evil action, let him change it with his hand, and if he is not able to do so, then with his tongue, and if he is not able to do so, then with his heart. And that is the weakest of faith. It was related by Muslim.",
